brew_info/
roles/elliotweiser.osx-command-line-tools/
.env

# Codex's interactive `/import` writes a byte-identical duplicate of the TRACKED
# .claude/skills/ansible-idempotency-check/SKILL.md, which is the canonical copy
# and the one docs/writing-roles.md refers to.
.agents/


__pycache__/

# JVM crash reports: mise installs Java from this checkout, and a build that dies at
# startup drops its report here (m2, 2026-10-11).
hs_err_pid*.log

# macOS Finder metadata. On a GUI Mac (notably the shared archs-mac-mini) Finder drops a
# .DS_Store into the checkout; an untracked one next to a path an incoming commit touches makes
# the nightly `git pull --rebase` refuse, which kills that host's whole provisioning run (archs,
# 2026-10-28, coding-agent Q-entry).
.DS_Store
